# ROUTE STEPS -- pipe-separated. Columns:
#   route_id | step | name | reactants | products | conditions | reaction_class
# reactants/products: compound ids from data/catalog/compounds/, joined with " + ".
# A species that appears on BOTH sides of one step is a catalyst for that step.
# reaction_class is the transformation family; tools/build_catalog.py compares the
# distinct classes here against the templates in src/chemsim/reactions/library.py.
